# Fallback for builds that use the repository root as context without BuildKit.
# BuildKit (the default in Docker Engine 23+ and Docker Compose v2) prefers the
# per-Dockerfile ignore files: backend/Dockerfile.dockerignore and
# frontend/Dockerfile.dockerignore.
.git
.github
.claude
docs
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.venv
**/__pycache__
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.log
